sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant N as Nginx (:80)
    participant A as FastAPI (:8000)
    participant D as SQLite
    C->>N: POST /tarefas {"titulo": "..."}
    N->>A: repassa a requisição
    A->>A: valida o JSON (Pydantic)
    A->>D: INSERT INTO tarefas
    D-->>A: id da nova tarefa
    A-->>N: 201 Created + tarefa em JSON
    N-->>C: resposta
